</div></div></section></section><section id="notes1"><h2 class="pmc_sec_title">Author Contributions</h2>
<p>Conceptualization, E.C. and O.A.; methodology, E.C., O.A., N.D. and X.C. (behavioral tests); formal analysis, E.C. and O.A.; investigation, E.C., O.A., I.C., V.C. and B.G.; data curation, E.C. and O.A.; writing—original draft preparation, E.C.; writing—review and editing, O.A.; visualization, E.C.; supervision, O.A., C.A.-G. and T.D.C.; project administration, O.A. and C.A.-G. All authors have read and agreed to the published version of the manuscript.</p></section><section id="notes2"><h2 class="pmc_sec_title">Institutional Review Board Statement</h2>
<p>All experiments were approved by the ethical comity (C2EA, IRSN, France) and received agreement from the French Ministry of Research under the reference APAFIS#11488.</p></section><section id="notes3"><h2 class="pmc_sec_title">Data Availability Statement</h2>
<p>Transcriptomics data are available under the Gene Expression Omnibus GEO repository: <a href="https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/geo/query/acc.cgi?acc=GSE206573" class="usa-link" data-ga-action="click_feat_suppl" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GSE206573</a>.</p></section><section id="notes4"><h2 class="pmc_sec_title">Conflicts of Interest</h2>
<p>The authors declare no conflict of interest.</p></section><section id="funding-statement1" lang="en"><h2 class="pmc_sec_title">Funding Statement</h2>
<p>This research was performed in the framework of the IRSN (Institut de Radioprotection et de Sûreté Nucléaire) working program.</p></section><section id="fn-group1" class="fn-group"><h2 class="pmc_sec_title">Footnotes</h2>
